{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55276","headline":"起居帖 · 杨凝式","name":"起居帖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行住坐卧处，手摩胁与肚，心腹通快时，两手肠下踞。\n踞之彻膀腰，背拳摩肾部。\n才觉力倦来，即使家人助。\n行之不厌频，昼夜无穷数，岁久积功成，渐入神仙路。\n（见明刻本朱存理辑《铁网珊瑚·书品》卷一。\n）（按：诗後题云：「乾佑元年冬残腊暮，华阳焦上人尊师处传，杨凝式。\n」又附米友仁跋云：「右杨凝式书神仙起居法八行，臣米友仁鉴定真蹟跋。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨凝式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55276.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55276","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}